{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0180-s003", "text": "Fråga din skola om du har rätt till skolresestöd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045901211071+0000-5/hb-c08-u0180-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.2222900390625, "generation_seconds": 16.599271402927116, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0181-s001", "text": "Om du studerar vid en högskola får du också måltidsstöd (ateriatuki).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045901211071+0000-5/hb-c08-u0181-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.478367346938776, "peak": 0.283172607421875, "generation_seconds": 19.25796118285507, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0181-s002", "text": "Du kan få måltidsstödet endast i läroanstalternas egna restauranger.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045901211071+0000-5/hb-c08-u0181-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.060408163265306, "peak": 0.3148193359375, "generation_seconds": 19.515877158148214, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0181-s003", "text": "Detta innebär att studeranden betalar mindre för måltiderna än andra som besöker restaurangen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045901211071+0000-5/hb-c08-u0181-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.40618896484375, "generation_seconds": 25.0235222899355, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0181-s004", "text": "Du behöver inte ansöka separat om måltidsstödet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045901211071+0000-5/hb-c08-u0181-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.597551020408163, "peak": 0.37933349609375, "generation_seconds": 16.99024210497737, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0181-s005", "text": "Du behöver bara visa upp ditt studentkort när du betalar för måltiden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045901211071+0000-5/hb-c08-u0181-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.060408163265306, "peak": 0.317291259765625, "generation_seconds": 16.72796619613655, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0182-s001", "text": "Du har inte rätt till måltidsstöd om du är i Finland endast på arbetspraktik (työharjoittelu) som ingår i en utländsk examen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045901211071+0000-5/hb-c08-u0182-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.866938775510205, "peak": 0.270416259765625, "generation_seconds": 33.352446233155206, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0183-s001", "text": "Utländska studerande kan ansöka om olika penningunderstöd för finländska högskolor.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045901211071+0000-5/hb-c08-u0183-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.43145751953125, "generation_seconds": 20.68377113295719, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
